# Queues and cron

Queues (BullMQ)
- Defined under app/server/queues/*: backupQueue, plaidSyncQueue, plaidSyncBalanceQueue, recalculateQueue
- queuesClient.ts wires connections and admin toggles

Cron jobs (nuxt-cron)
- app/server/cron/*:
  - backup.daily.ts — periodic backups
  - bill-reminders.hourly.ts — bill reminder evaluation
  - plaid.daily.ts, plaid-balance.hourly.ts — Plaid data syncs
  - recalculate.hourly.ts — schedule forecast recalculations
  - crypto-balance.hourly.ts — crypto balances via AlchemyService

Patterns
- Keep handlers small and idempotent
- Enqueue granular jobs with clear IDs; use IntegrationJobLog for job audit where appropriate
- Add tests for job logic in server/services/__tests__ or server/lib/__tests__ as applicable
